    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like my being here makes everything harder for everyone. like, if i wasn't constantly struggling or stressed or broke, they could actually have a chance. i just feel like i'm a weight around their necks. everything i do just seems to make their lives more difficult instead of better.",
